        "original_id": "60712bf2-1545-5267-a807-92c56e88c07a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Denzel Washington, David Hewlett, Herman Boone\n- Roles: actor, director, producer, writer, voice actor, football coach\n- TV Shows: Stargate SG-1, Stargate Atlantis, Stargate Universe\n- Films: Remember the Titans\n- Organizations: T. C. Williams High School\n\nFacts:\n- Herman Ike Boone was born on October 28, 1935.\n- Denzel Hayes Washington Jr. was born on December 28, 1954.\n- David Ian Hewlett was born on 18 April 1968.\n- Herman Boone is a former American high school football coach.\n- In 1971, Herman Boone coached the T. C. Williams High School football team to a 13-0 season, a state championship, and national championship runner-up status.\n- The 1971 Herman Boone team became the basis for the 2000 film Remember the Titans.\n- In Remember the Titans, Denzel Washington portrayed Herman Boone.\n- Denzel Washington is an American actor, director, and producer.\n- David Hewlett is an English-born Canadian actor, writer, director, and voice actor.\n- David Hewlett is best known for playing Dr. Rodney McKay on Stargate SG-1, Stargate Atlantis, and Stargate Universe.",
